<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57892" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κληρ-ωτήριον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κληρωτρίς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				681
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				146
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				74.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				63.2
			</span></i> (unless in signf. <i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Not. Arch.</u>
				4.20
			</span></i> (Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>place where elections by lot</i> or <i>distributions of jurors
				were held</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				64.3
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.793d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				9.44
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>list of citizens</i>, so called because jurors were selected
			from it by lot, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναγραφῆναι εἰς τὰ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					229.53
				</span></i>
			 (Smyrna, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
